Package: @PKG@
Version: @VERSION@
Depends: libc
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: Behavioral reimplementation of the GL.iNet/Quectel quec_battery charging daemon. Installs /usr/bin/quec_battery2 and redirects the live /usr/bin/quec_battery path to it, preserving the stock binary as /usr/bin/quec_battery.stock.
